quest title=The Door in the Sky
quest intro=A perfect little town where it rains on cue. Start in the square - and smile, you may be on camera.
step reach|square|1|Walk into Halcyon Cove's town square
step read|Welcome board|1|Read the town's welcome board
step read|Neighbour's script|1|Read the note left on the porch table of the house east of the square
step collect|story:tape|4|Find the four hidden cameras round the town and pull their tapes
step reach|weathertower|1|Climb the weather tower on the hill south of the town
step read|Weather log|1|Read the weather log in the hut at the tower's foot
step collect|story:boothkey|1|Switch the rain machine off - its box holds the booth key
step reach|moon|1|Find the booth inside the "moon" on the hilltop
step read|Director's journal|1|Read the director's journal
step collect|story:exitkey|1|Play the four tapes on the booth's console
step reach|skywall|1|Sail east to the horizon - and find the wall
step open|The last prop crate|1|Climb the stair, open the door in the sky, and open what waits behind it
quest done=You walk out through the door in the sky, onto a narrow ledge over the real sea. Behind you, Halcyon Cove is quiet: no rain, no cameras, no script - just a town, and an island, and the way out.
quest reward=Plastic*10;Coconut*4;Watermelon*2

save Halcyon Cove
